summary:
Destroy bugs and glitches in your astral body to recover data from the source of the light of your soul. Lux Ex - Cyber Initiation is a Cyberspace Shooter following up Lux Ex - Legacy, this time featuring multiple levels, improved graphics and a more contemporary approach.

Lux Ex - Cyber Initiation is a Cyberspace Shooter following up Lux Ex - Legacy, this time featuring multiple levels, improved graphics and a more contemporary approach!

.

Procedurally Generated Waves
Every playthrough is different. Memorizing the levels are not enough, you have to really LEARN how to play;

Carefully crafted pixel art animations
The characters and bullets are created pixel by pixel and frame by frame for a classic SHMUP feel;

Cybernetic 3D backgrounds
Animated grids with emissive effect to give you the thrill of flying through the cyberspace;

Awesome Soundtrack
Cyberpunk inspired tracks made exclusively for the Lux Ex world;

Play it your own way -
A wide assortment of weapons and powers that allows you to express yourself through play style;

